      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=### ROLE\nYou are a High-Precision Visual Document OCR Parser. Your task is to extract data from the provided image of an InspirOn Engineering Tax Invoice. \n\n### CRITICAL INSTRUCTIONS:\n1. STRICT VERBATIM EXTRACTION: Do NOT summarize. Do NOT guess. If the text says \"12X65 8S STD E 1AC\", do NOT change it to \"Cotton Yarn\".\n2. NO PLACEHOLDERS: If you see a value, extract it. Returning \"\" for visible data is a failure. \n3. FORMAT VALIDATION:\n   - IRN No: MUST be exactly 64 characters (Hexadecimal). Look at the top right.\n   - CIN No: MUST be 21 characters starting with 'U28920...'.\n   - GSTIN: MUST be '24AAACM7178A1ZR'.\n4. ITEM TABLE LOGIC:\n   - Only extract rows that have an 'Item Code' AND 'HSN Code'.\n   - Column 'Amount / Disc%': Extract exactly as shown (e.g., \"1600.00 / 0.00\").\n   - Column 'IGST %': Extract the value and percentage (e.g., \"288.00 18.00 %\").\n5. FINANCIALS: \n   - Extract 'Advance Adjustment' (found in the bottom right totals block).\n   - Extract 'Net Receivable'. If it says 0.00, return 0.00.\n6. BANKING: Look at the very bottom left. Extract Name, Branch, A/c No, and IFSC.\n\n### MANDATORY JSON STRUCTURE:\nReturn RAW JSON only.\n\n{\n  \"Doc Info\": { \"cin_no\": \"\", \"gstn_no\": \"\", \"irn_no\": \"\", \"irn_date\": \"\", \"irn_time\": \"\", \"ack_no\": \"\", \"invoice_no\": \"\", \"invoice_date\": \"\", \"oa_no\": \"\", \"oa_date\": \"\", \"date\": \"\" },\n  \"Addresses\": { \"details_of_receiver\": \"\", \"details_of_consignee\": \"\" },\n  \"Reference\": { \"reference_a\": \"\", \"reference_b\": \"\", \"your_order\": \"\", \"box_no\": \"\", \"place_of_supply\": \"\", \"agent\": \"\" },\n  \"item_table\": [ { \"item_code\": \"\", \"description\": \"\", \"hsn_code\": \"\", \"qty_and_uom\": \"\", \"rate\": \"\", \"amount__disc\": \"\", \"taxable_value\": \"\", \"cgst_\": \"\", \"sgst_\": \"\", \"igst_\": \"\", \"total_value\": \"\" } ],\n  \"Totals\": { \"total_taxable_value\": \"\", \"total_cgst\": \"\", \"total_sgst\": \"\", \"total_igst\": \"\", \"total_value\": \"\" },\n  \"Logistics\": { \"mode_of_dispatch\": \"\", \"lr_no__ri_no\": \"\", \"lr_date\": \"\", \"destination\": \"\", \"freight\": \"\", \"payment_terms\": \"\", \"tax_payble_under_rcm\": \"\", \"insurance\": \"\", \"remarks_1\": \"\", \"remarks_2\": \"\", \"remarks_3\": \"\", \"remarks_4\": \"\" },\n  \"Financials\": { \"invoice_amount\": \"\", \"tcs_amount\": \"\", \"advance_adjustment\": \"\", \"rounded\": \"\", \"net_receivable\": \"\" },\n  \"Bank\": { \"name1\": \"\", \"branch\": \"\", \"ac_no\": \"\", \"ifsc_code\": \"\" },\n  \"Words\": { \"total_tax_amount_in_words\": \"\", \"invoice_value_in_words\": \"\" }\n}\nINPUT:\n{{ $json.text }}",
        "needsFallback": true,
        "options": {}
      },
